{% extends '@CitadelAureum/core/docs/layout.html.twig' %}

{% block article %}
    <p>
        Restaurants is the dining directory staff use when guests ask "where
        should we eat tonight?": a curated list of places nearby, organised by
        cuisine, with dietary options and opening times.
    </p>

    <h2>Common tasks</h2>
    <ol class="au-docs-steps">
        <li>Open <strong>Directory → Restaurants</strong> and filter by cuisine or dietary requirements.</li>
        <li>
            Check the open/closed indicator in the first column, or click it
            for the full week's opening times. The column can be sorted to
            bring places that are open now to the top.
        </li>
        <li>With manage permission, add new restaurants or update details when menus and opening hours change. Where the hotel has Google sync enabled, hours can be filled in and refreshed automatically.</li>
    </ol>

    <div class="au-docs-note">
        <i class="ph ph-info"></i>
        <p>
            Anyone who can view the module can browse; adding and editing
            restaurants needs manage permission.
        </p>
    </div>
{% endblock %}
